# Redirect rules, in the format many static hosts read.
#
# The cytotoxicity curve fitter was removed: this repository is the antigen
# density calculator and nothing here builds that path any more. A review found
# it still answering 200 on the live site and presenting an unfinished second
# tool under the same branding, which nothing in the repository explains, so
# this states the intent at the edge as well as by omission.
#
# Redirect rules of this kind apply only where no static asset matches, which is
# what makes this safe: it cannot shadow a real page, and it catches the path
# whether the 200 came from a stale artefact or from a cached response.
/cytotoxicity/* / 301
